# Canonical direction

Before any implementation, read `docs/roadmap/WORKOS_V1_DELIVERY_ROADMAP.md`.

Before any UI/UX task, also read `docs/architecture/WORKOS_UI_UX_DIRECTION_CANON.md`.

Stop and report if the prompt contradicts those documents. Do not update the canons only to justify a build after the fact.

Do not hardcode business truth in the UI. Do not expose backend details in operator UI. Do not expand beyond the active milestone.

Report:

```text
ROADMAP_READ
UI_UX_CANON_READ
DIRECTION_CONFLICT
```
